        "en": "Label: use with caution in older adults, usually starting at the low end of the dose range."
      },
      "quote": "In general, dose adjustment for an elderly patient should be cautious, reflecting the greater frequency of decreased hepatic, renal, or cardiac function, and of concomitant disease or other drug therapy.",
